## 🔧 **BUILD ERROR QUICK FIXES**

### Dependency Errors

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Could not find artifact` | Check version, add repository |
| `Version conflict` | Use `<dependencyManagement>` |
| `Missing classifier` | Add `<classifier>mule-plugin</classifier>` |

### Syntax Errors

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Unexpected element` | Check spelling, validate XML |
| `Cannot resolve symbol` | Add missing namespace declaration |
| `Invalid content` | Verify against XSD schema |

### Deployment Errors

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Property not found` | Add to environment YAML |
| `Deployment failed` | Check credentials, app name uniqueness |
| `OutOfMemoryError` | Increase worker size |

